Maintainer: Alberto Basso <17047798+albertsdk@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/albertsdk/hsync-rendezvous
Description: HSYNC - P2P rendezvous node (no-log)
 hsync-rendezvous is the Internet rendezvous node of the HSYNC sync network.
 .
 It tells P2P clients which peers are currently online, speaking the
 rdv/1 protocol over QUIC/UDP 443 (TLS 1.3, RETRY + address validation).
 .
 Everything lives in RAM with a 60-second TTL: no persistence, no logs,
 no PII on disk. Protected buckets authenticate queries with
 HMAC-derived tokens compared in constant time.
Depends: systemd
